'''Cosplay Fans''' (大炎上, ''Daienjō'', '''Blazing''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Strengthen" Effect UP (M): Strengthen Up buff increases by 30%.

